// ============================================================
// HOW IT WORKS NOW
//  1. On power-up the LCD connects to Wi-Fi and shows a
//     6-character code. Nothing else runs until a website user
//     links the device (website > "Link Device").
//  2. After linking, the main screens appear. The sensor is read
//     ONLY when you press the "Scan now" button (top bar); the
//     reading is then sent to the website, into the account that
//     linked the device. No username is stored in this code.
//  3. To hand the device to someone else: hold your finger on the
//     "SoilSense" logo (top-left) for 1.5 s, or press "Unlink" on
//     the website. The LCD goes back to the code screen.
// ============================================================


